WEBVTT

00:39:26.413 --> 00:39:31.663
there'll be hundreds and thousands
of jobs to do with solar and wind

00:39:31.746 --> 00:39:37.121
and all these other technologies that
could be developed provide jobs

00:39:37.121 --> 00:39:38.121
for people.

00:39:38.413 --> 00:39:43.496
Yes. Jane, have there ever been times
when you've lost hope and and if so,

00:39:43.496 --> 00:39:45.621
where have you turn to to rediscover it?

00:39:47.413 --> 00:39:51.996
I never totally lost it. You can't
look around the world today

00:39:52.538 --> 00:39:55.704
and really look around and
see what's happening

00:39:55.996 --> 00:40:00.288
and really read about what's happening
to the environment and to society